    ],
    "text": "1.3  ENGINE AND FUEL SYSTEM",
    "role": "body",
    "style": {
     "bold": true,
     "italic": false,
     "size": 13,
     "color": 1710618,
     "align": "left",
     "list_level": 0,
     "indent": 0
    },
    "translation": {
     "text": "1.3  发动机和燃油系统",
     "status": "machine",
     "revision": 1
    }
   },
   {
    "seg_id": 302,
    "page": 3,
    "order_index": 15,
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "bbox": [
     72,
     132.0,
     511.65,
     154.9
    ],
    "line_boxes": [
     [
      72,
      132.0,
      511.65,
      142.5
     ],
     [
      72,
      144.4,
      461.05,
      154.9
     ]
    ],
    "text": "The engine is controlled by the digital engine control unit, which schedules fuel flow, nozzle position and afterburner operation. The EPU provides emergency electrical and hydraulic power.",
    "role": "body",
    "style": {
     "bold": false,
     "italic": false,
     "size": 10,
     "color": 1710618,
     "align": "left",
     "list_level": 0,
     "indent": 0
    },
    "translation": {
     "text": "发动机由数字发动机控制单元控制，该单元安排燃油流量、喷口位置和加力工作。EPU 提供应急电源和液压动力。",
     "status": "seeded",
     "revision": 1
    }
   },
   {
    "seg_id": 303,
    "page": 3,
    "order_index": 16,
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "bbox": [
     72,
     207.0,
     496.66,
     229.9
    ],
    "line_boxes": [
     [
      72,
      207.0,
      496.66,
      217.5
     ],
     [
      72,
      219.4,
      132.03,
      229.9
     ]
    ],
    "text": "The fuel system stores JP-8 in the fuselage and wing tanks and supplies the engine through two boost pumps.",
    "role": "body",
    "style": {
     "bold": false,
     "italic": false,
     "size": 10,
     "color": 1710618,
     "align": "left",
     "list_level": 0,
     "indent": 0
    },
    "translation": {
     "text": "燃油系统在机身和机翼油箱中储存 JP-8，并通过两台增压泵向发动机供油。",
     "status": "machine",
     "revision": 1
    }
   },
   {
    "seg_id": 304,
    "page": 3,
    "order_index": 17,
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "bbox": [
     72,
     260.0,
     389.38,
     270.5
    ],
    "line_boxes": [
     [
      72,
      260.0,
      389.38,
      270.5
     ]
    ],
    "text": "Fuel quantity is displayed on the fuel quantity indicator and on the MFD.",
    "role": "body",
    "style": {
     "bold": false,
     "italic": false,
     "size": 10,
     "color": 1710618,
     "align": "left",
     "list_level": 0,
