     ],
     [
      72,
      144.4,
      408.28,
      154.9
     ]
    ],
    "text": "The FLCS is a four-channel digital system. Each channel processes the same inputs and compares its output with the other channels before the actuator commands are issued.",
    "role": "body",
    "style": {
     "bold": false,
     "italic": false,
     "size": 10,
     "color": 1710618,
     "align": "left",
     "list_level": 0,
     "indent": 0
    },
    "translation": {
     "text": "FLCS 为四余度数字系统。每个通道处理相同的输入，并在发出作动器指令之前将其输出与其他通道进行比较。",
     "status": "machine",
     "revision": 1
    }
   },
   {
    "seg_id": 203,
    "page": 2,
    "order_index": 8,
    "kind": "list_item",
    "bbox": [
     90,
     188.0,
     304.12,
     198.5
    ],
    "line_boxes": [
     [
      90,
      188.0,
      304.12,
      198.5
     ]
    ],
    "text": "• Sidestick controller — pitch and roll commands",
    "role": "body",
    "style": {
     "bold": false,
     "italic": false,
     "size": 10,
     "color": 1710618,
     "align": "left",
     "list_level": 1,
     "indent": 0
    },
    "translation": {
     "text": "• 侧杆控制器 — 俯仰和滚转指令",
     "status": "machine",
     "revision": 1
    }
   },
   {
    "seg_id": 209,
    "page": 2,
    "order_index": 9,
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "bbox": [
     72.0,
     360.0,
     351.0,
     370.5
    ],
    "line_boxes": [
     [
      72.0,
      360.0,
      351.0,
      370.5
     ]
    ],
    "text": "The emergency power unit is armed automatically after takeoff.",
    "role": "body",
    "style": {
     "bold": false,
     "italic": false,
     "size": 10,
     "color": 1710618,
     "align": "left",
     "list_level": 0,
     "indent": 0
    },
    "translation": {
     "text": "应急动力装置在起飞后自动预位。",
     "status": "machine",
     "revision": 1
    }
   },
   {
    "seg_id": 204,
    "page": 2,
    "order_index": 10,
    "kind": "list_item",
    "bbox": [
     90,
     204.0,
     246.33,
     214.5
    ],
    "line_boxes": [
     [
      90,
      204.0,
      246.33,
      214.5
     ]
    ],
    "text": "• Rudder pedals — yaw commands",
    "role": "body",
    "style": {
     "bold": false,
     "italic": false,
     "size": 10,
     "color": 1710618,
     "align": "left",
     "list_level": 1,
     "indent": 0
    },
    "translation": {
     "text": "• 脚舵 — 偏航指令",
     "status": "machine",
     "revision": 1
    }
   },
   {
    "seg_id": 205,
    "page": 2,
    "order_index": 11,
    "kind": "list_item",
    "bbox": [
